  "reference": "1 Sam. 31",
  "verseCount": 13,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "31",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 31"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "31",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Atwanare a Saul ka ŋidwe keŋ ŋulusapa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu Ŋipilistin ŋulu aŋaarito ajore kitijikis Ŋisirael; tobwaŋas Ŋisirael, toarakis Ŋipilistin ikes ŋulu alalak lomukura ŋolo a Gilboa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toditasi Ŋipilistin Saul ka ŋidwe keŋ ŋulusapa; toara ikes ŋidwe a Saul ŋulusapa lu: Yonasan, Abinadab ka Malicisua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Topotyor ejie nooi aneni ayai Saul; toditasi iŋes ŋulu atiŋito ŋikaleŋeleŋe, apotu towana iŋes nooi a ŋikaleŋeleŋe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema nai Saul neni a ekile a ŋolo aryoŋit ŋiboro keŋ ŋulu ke ejie, “Tolemu ekileŋ kon ikicumya ayoŋ, ikotere nyepotu ŋituŋa ŋul ŋulu nyileŋeritae akicum ayoŋ, ido okokyanatar.” Nai abu ŋolo aryoŋit ŋiboro a Saul ŋulu ke ejie nyecamu akicum Saul, anerae eilit iŋes. Aŋun, abu Saul tolemu ekileŋ keŋ a elope toramakin lokileŋ kicumakin bon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani iŋolikini ŋolo aryoŋit ŋiboro a Saul ŋulu ke ejie atemar eridak Saul, toramakin iŋes daŋ lokileŋ keŋ a elope kicumakin bon, totwaka ikes kaapei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, apotu Saul ka ŋidwe keŋ ŋulusapa ŋiuni ka ŋolo aryoŋit ŋiboro keŋ ŋulu ke ejie ta ŋikajiok ŋulu arukito ka iŋes daadaŋ totwaka akoloŋit apei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani iirarete Ŋisirael ŋulu ayakasi ekekwaye akadipaalat ŋina a Yesireel ka ŋulu ayakasi ekekwaye aŋolol Yorodan atemar abwaŋasi Ŋisirael ka aari Saul ka ŋidwe keŋ ŋulusapa, apotu kimyekis ŋitaunio kec, toema nariet. Apotu nai Ŋipilistin potu toloma lotaunio ŋul.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani akoloŋit ŋina atupakini ŋin, apotu Ŋipilistin toloto akilac ŋituŋa ŋulu aris ikes keara ŋul. Toryamut akuwan a Saul ka ŋuna a ŋidwe keŋ a ŋulusapa a ŋuluuni eperete alomukura a ŋolo a Gilboa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Totubosi ikes akou a Saul, ido tolacasi ŋiboro keŋ ŋulu ke ejie. kiyakiyasi ŋituŋa nakwap a Ŋipilistin daadaŋ alimor ŋakiro ŋuna ajokak ŋuna ka akiloun a ŋin; ikotere elimoryo ŋakiro ŋun anakais a ŋakujo kec ka alotuŋa kec a daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiwuakis Ŋipilistin ŋiboro a Saul ŋulu ke ejie kai ka akuj kec a ŋina anyaritae Asitarite, ido toenikis akuwan a saul narwatata ŋina ke etaun a ŋolo anyaritae Bes-San. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai ani iirarete ŋituŋa ŋulu a Yabes-Gilead ŋakiro ŋuna kitiyata Ŋipilistin neni a Saul, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tonyout ŋikilyok daadaŋ ŋulu adedeŋ, toloto akiwar akuwar kia, tolemut anarwatata a Bes-San akuwan a Saul ka ŋuna a ŋidwe keŋ a ŋulusapa a ŋuluuni, yaut ikes ŋawat ŋun tari Yabes, kicunya a nen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kidepasi nai ŋakoyo kec, tonukakis Yabes, kwap ekitoe ŋolo esibit ekwaakwaa, ido kiredakis akiron ŋirwa ŋikanikaarei.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
